WEBVTT

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:10.990
You're late.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.110
I ran into a bit of trouble.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.950
Who is he?

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:18.260
Ichikawa Zanakurou.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.840
He's from the Ichikawa family, who is famous for its kabuki theater.

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:25.460
Even though he's still in middle school, he's also a very busy kabuki actor.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.960
A-A kabuki actor?

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:32.970
A kabuki actor I may be, but I really am a member of the lower middle class without a name.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:37.930
Although, to be precise, I <i>do</i>  have a name.

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:20.490
A kabuki actor, really?

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:23.240
I didn't expect to see you here of all places.

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:24.950
Good to meet you.

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:27.020
Same here.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:28.910
It is my honor to meet you all.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.310
He seems like a nice person.

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:32.370
Yeah.

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:38.920
The twelve of you here will be entering the planetary soccer tournament, Grand Celesta Galaxy.

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:41.130
Wait.

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.640
Was he also chosen because...?

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.240
Yes.

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:48.640
He has the same beast power as you.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:56.150
At first, he showed absolutely no interest in negotiating, so I sent Endou to him.

00:02:56.750 --> 00:03:01.420
I estimated that only Endou would be able to persuade him successfully.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:06.550
He kept turning me down at first, though.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:10.920
Endou-san.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:17.530
Why is someone of such high regard like yourself so intent on recruiting someone like me to soccer?

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:21.600
There must be a suitable reason for you doing so.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.430
You can tell, huh?

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:25.200
Well, I guess it's pretty obvious.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.820
All right then, I'll tell you everything.

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:29.130
Please do.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:34.020
The reason I want you to play soccer is because...

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:40.190
I want you to fight the universe!

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:47.410
I could only be surprised by the sudden news...

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:53.960
But as Endou-san has said that I have that power within me, I have trusted those words as he has prepared me with training.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:57.880
Another beginner at soccer, huh?

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.800
A picture is worth a thousand words.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:01.920
Allow me to show you.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.300
Thank you for your time.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:05.720
No problem!

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.220
Let's see what you can do.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.320
I'll stop you!

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:22.490
What?!

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:24.730
Wow.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:30.410
When you consider the weight on his pivot leg, it ought to be pretty difficult maintaining a stance like that.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:37.330
Nice!

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:40.050
He does have great ability.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:44.370
You survived Endou-san's training after all!

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:45.730
That was amazing!

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:47.970
I thought you would say that.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.890
Thank you, Captain.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:53.640
We'll fight with the twelve people here.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.440
Yeah.

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:55.890
But...

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.860
Will we be able to succeed?

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:01.910
We can't afford to lose, no matter what.

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:05.150
The fate of Earth is in our hands...

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:07.610
It's too great of a responsibility...

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:12.420
Guys...

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:13.580
Hey, everyone.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.540
Do you like soccer?

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:17.920
Well?

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:23.800
It's not really that I like it... I guess, it's more like I enjoy it a lot now.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:28.340
I feel as if I've found something I can absorb myself in completely.

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:32.750
An answer can always be found using theory.

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:36.350
In that sense, I'd say it's a pretty interesting sport.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:40.610
That means you like soccer, guys.

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:50.530
The two most important things are how much you like soccer and the drive to win against all odds.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.830
From watching your matches, I felt it...

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.040
Right here.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:59.710
Those feelings are the strongest in you guys, compared to everyone else.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.860
You will be able to conquer any obstacles.

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:05.800
You guys will be able to save Earth.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.810
Well... I think it's fine.

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:15.810
Fighting for Earth, I mean.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:17.310
Sakura!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:21.460
I mean, we might get to be superheroes!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:24.240
And being the best in the galaxy sounds cool, right?

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:25.350
Yeah, I've decided!

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:27.280
I'm going to space!

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.370
Me too.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:32.820
I'm not gonna let Earth be invaded by aliens.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:36.220
My friends are here, and my friends of friends.

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:37.330
I'll protect them all!

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:41.480
Meeting lifeforms outside of Earth will be very interesting.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:46.600
It will be worth going to see what sort of mentality they possess.

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:53.680
Indeed, I look forward to seeing how far Earth's laws of physics and theories will manage to hold against the universe.

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:56.240
Oh, fine, all right!

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:57.880
We just have to do this, right?

00:06:58.550 --> 00:06:59.690
I've made up my mind, too!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:01.690
I'll go, too.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.190
Guys!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:07.280
Going into space... I...

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:09.240
Konoha-chan...

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:19.600
I'm home!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.660
Have you been well, Sasuke?

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:23.130
Tenma, welcome back!

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:24.540
Shinsuke!

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.400
Welcome back.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:27.710
Aki-nee!

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.930
Tenma, congratulations on winning the Asia district preliminaries!

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:33.570
I was so impressed, I ended up crying!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.530
That's right...

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:43.510
Shinsuke and Aki-nee don't know the truth.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.770
Inazuma Japan is working so hard!

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:51.680
With every game I watched, I could tell they've been training to get better and better!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:54.840
Coach Kuroiwa knew what he was doing!

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.280
Y-Yeah...

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:58.600
The world tournament is next, right?

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:01.710
I just know you guys will win!

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.640
I'll be cheering for you with everything I have!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.670
What's wrong, Tenma?

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:12.630
I have to tell you both the truth.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.550
Still not good enough...

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:27.480
I have to raise the level higher...

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.360
Ibuki.

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:30.110
Shindou.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.350
Have you finished everything you need to do before we leave?

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:37.620
Hey, Shindou.

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:42.620
You taught me what it was I should be doing.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:48.340
That I shouldn't be defending the goal on my own, but with the help of the others.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:52.620
But the weight of even a single goal this time will be different.

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:55.340
It'll decide the fate of the world.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.800
Will I be able to defend the goal properly?

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:02.910
Are you still fixated on the idea of acting solo?

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.510
That's not what I'm saying.

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:09.750
I just don't want to bring trouble to the team because I'm the weak link.

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:14.740
Someone once told us this.

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:18.510
That soccer is a harmony made by eleven people.

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.040
A harmony made by eleven people...

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:26.110
It's only when everyone on the team is united that we see victory in sight for the first time.

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:32.130
If you lose a point, we'll get it back for you no matter what.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.080
That's what a team does.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.170
Don't forget that.

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.390
Shindou...

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.060
Why is it you guys?!

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:50.640
Only the Earth Eleven can fight against the aliens.

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:51.770
Tenma...

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:54.510
I've decided.

00:09:54.510 --> 00:10:01.480
I'll go with this team to protect Earth, Shinsuke, Aki-nee, Sasuke, and everyone else.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:05.330
You've become more like a captain, Tenma.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:09.330
I'm not worried. This is you we're talking about.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.340
So go out there and play the way you want to.

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:14.950
Yeah!

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:16.310
I want to go, too.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:23.280
It hurt the whole time, how I couldn't fight with you guys as a representative.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:24.620
Shinsuke...

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.560
I want to help you, Tenma.

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:30.060
So please, take me with you!

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:32.660
Okay.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.780
Let's go together to see Coach Kuroiwa tomorrow and ask him.

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:40.020
For all we know, he might agree.

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:41.750
Okay, Shinsuke?

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:43.950
Tenma!

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:47.970
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:53.110
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.310
Does it taste good?

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:00.880
The bunnies sure are cute.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:02.800
Aoi-san.

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:08.950
I guess I have to go out to space, don't I.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:10.400
Space, huh...

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:14.190
It's a little scary, but it's the only way to save everyone.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:18.260
Tenma can be a bit unreliable at times...

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:23.200
So I can't help but think that I have to be there for him as the manager.

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:27.990
Oh, what now?

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:29.950
You're off to space this time?

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:35.970
Then we'll have to cheer you on through space TV.

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:38.630
Yeah, that's how people would normally react.

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:43.570
No matter what it is you tell me, I'm going to shine out there!

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:44.470
I'll be best in the universe!

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:50.350
You're reading too many science fiction novels.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.060
And what happened to soccer?

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:55.970
You're not against me playing soccer?

00:11:55.970 --> 00:12:01.280
Not only is he not against it, he's been checking up on all of your matches this whole time, Jin-chan.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:04.660
It's so I can drag you back to your studies the very moment you lose a game.

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:06.820
Papa!

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:08.970
Are you serious?

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:11.040
Yeah, I'm serious. Super serious.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:14.770
Whoa! You're going one-on-one with aliens!

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:17.750
Yeah, I'm off for a bit to be strongest in the galaxy.

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:21.720
I didn't know you could joke, Ryuu-chan.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:25.550
Oh, it was a joke, Kusaka-san?

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:26.720
No, it's not-

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:29.680
The world tournament is next, right?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.180
I'll be cheering for you! Do your best!

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:34.690
Okay...

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:43.700
Dad, I can't wait to see how well my analytical skills do in our fight with the aliens.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.280
I'll do my best.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:50.130
So watch over me, okay, Dad?

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:57.280
The man who aimed to be world boxing champ is now aiming even higher, eh?

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:58.380
Tetsu-san...

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:01.860
You believe me?

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:04.220
I can tell by the look in your eyes.

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:07.240
Face them without running away, you hear?

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:11.520
Then go tear off from their hands the title for champion of the universe!

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:14.110
Yeah, I'll do it!

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:17.200
I'll protect this sea no matter what!

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.690
Good luck, Nii-chan!

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:22.970
We'll be cheering for you!

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:26.320
I'd much rather be staying with you guys...

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.820
Don't worry about us.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.790
You're gonna be the hero that saves Earth!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:34.910
Me, a hero, huh?

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:38.580
Please!

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:41.960
Let me play soccer with the others!

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:44.110
I plead on his behalf, too!

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.770
Could you please bring Shinsuke along with us to space?

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:50.280
No. You will not be of any help.

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:53.000
Then you can test me!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.810
I've been training this whole time too, just as hard as them!

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:58.710
Coach Kuroiwa.

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:02.820
Even Shinsuke's feelings for soccer are as strong as ours.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.880
I'm sure he'll be of help to us.

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.780
So please!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.420
Tenma!

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:10.510
It's a waste of time.

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:12.780
No way...

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.000
Shinsuke...

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:19.060
I want to play soccer with you guys.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:20.790
I want to be useful.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:23.130
So why can't I...?

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.460
Hey, Shinsuke!

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:30.260
Why don't we play soccer?

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:37.230
It's been awhile since we played soccer like this.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:42.220
I'm really grateful that I met soccer.

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:47.320
It's helped me make friends who are dear to me, and meet my best friend!

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:49.260
Shinsuke.

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:53.280
No matter what troubles came, you always faced them down head-on, Tenma.

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:55.910
That's why I was able to do my best, too.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.540
I didn't want to lose to you.

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:01.250
I was able to do my best because I had you and everyone else, too.

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:03.790
Tenma.

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.800
I love soccer!

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:09.720
I love soccer, too!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:12.970
Let's play soccer again some time.

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:13.760
Yeah!

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:15.770
Tenma!

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:18.770
It's you!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.520
We heard everything from Sorano.

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:25.060
You guys are lucky, getting to explore space for free.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:27.480
Kariya, they're not going on a vacation.

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:29.930
You're up against aliens, right?

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:32.660
Sounds like it's gonna be a fun battle.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:36.240
Kurumada-san, they're fighting for the fate of the world, you know...

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:39.680
Nah, they'll be fine.

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:40.570
Yeah!

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:42.750
Fight for our share, too.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.250
Show them all the Raimon spirit!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:48.710
Yes! We'll definitely win the tournament!

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.820
Hey, are you feeling restless too, or is it just me?

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:54.110
With these members, it's gotta be soccer!

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:57.310
Yes! Let's all play soccer!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:58.730
Yeah, great idea!

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:00.770
Alright, guys, let's do this!

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:01.230
Yeah!

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.900
I'm joining you.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.200
Shindou-san!

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:10.940
Fight without any regrets and believe in yourself.

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:14.910
But honestly, I'm not too worried about you.

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:17.040
Nii-san.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:20.910
There's everyone.

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:22.910
Go on, Kyousuke.

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:42.230
Those three have leveled up.

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:48.110
Nice cut, Tenma!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.530
If it isn't the Earth Eleven!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.110
Come join us!

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.240
Eh, you don't mind?

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.310
Of course not!

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:00.830
Let's talk through soccer!

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:02.910
Bring it on!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.330
You're being way too excited...

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.730
Not bad!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:32.600
I was mistaken.

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:35.200
The eleven that you chose have real strength.

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:42.350
Now I can say that I believe the Earth Eleven will save Earth.

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:43.600
Is that so.

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:47.210
However, I do not believe in them.

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:52.710
I merely want a 100% victory.

00:17:53.570 --> 00:18:00.140
You guys will be dealing with the best in the galaxy, which no one on Earth has ever accomplished before.

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:01.640
Shinsuke!

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:03.140
Come on!

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:08.240
Nice save, Shinsuke!

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:10.690
Playing soccer with all you have sure is fun!

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:12.190
Tenma...

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:16.820
I'm having so much fun right now!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.370
That's it!

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:20.820
Don't forget how it feels to have fun!

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:25.310
As long as you can feel that, you guys are invincible!

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:32.460
All twelve of you are here.

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:34.600
Matsukaze Tenma.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.080
Shindou Takuto.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:37.730
Tsurugi Kyousuke.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.150
Matatagi Hayato.

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:40.550
Nozaki Sakura.

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:41.970
Ibuki Munemasa.

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:43.620
Tetsukado Shin.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.240
Manabe Jin'ichirou.

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:46.620
Minaho Kazuto.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:48.200
Kusaka Ryuuji.

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:49.660
Morimura Konoha.

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:51.020
Ichikawa Zanakurou.

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:55.020
Those are the representatives for Earth, Earth Eleven.

00:18:55.420 --> 00:19:00.150
Excuse me, but I don't see a vehicle that's the equivalent of a spaceship anywhere...

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:44.870
W-What the heck is this?

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:46.580
Whoa...

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:48.880
Is this a train?

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:52.840
It's a starship shaped like a train, called Galaxy Nauts.

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.580
Galaxy Nauts...

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:59.630
This spaceship was built based on the blueprints provided to us by the Council of the Galaxy Union.

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:06.970
A-Auntie?!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:09.150
That uniform! Could it be...?

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:11.940
That's right. I'm the conductor, the conductor.

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:15.020
Now, now, no time to be taking it easy.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:18.190
We're almost ready to leave! Get in, get in!

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:20.440
Make sure you have everything!

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:21.820
O-Okay!

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.530
Tenma...

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:40.480
We're finally off.

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:41.050
Yes.

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:42.480
All right...

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:44.510
Let's go, to space!

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:45.550
Yeah!

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:47.510
Let's head out!

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:10.220
Good luck!

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:12.000
Don't lose, guys!

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:15.550
Huh?

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:17.420
Shinsuke-kun?

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:25.860
Tenma...

00:22:54.110 --> 00:22:56.840
As we fly through space, a trial looms over us!

00:22:56.840 --> 00:22:59.270
Our first warp and the shadow of a stowaway!

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:02.440
And then, we land on the planet of our first match.

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:04.950
Next, Arrival At The Sand Planet!

00:23:04.950 --> 00:23:06.860
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:19.640
The Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy's proverb today is...

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:26.420
As long as you know how to have fun, you're invincible!

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:27.530
That's all!
